WEBVTT

00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:12,340
Question about chemo was also in regard to diet,

00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:14,900
resumed the diet the day after chemo,

00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,500
if so, any particular time of day does it depend

00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,380
on when to finish the impusion.

00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,860
So as far as fasting.

00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:25,620
So the chemo protocol and then fasting,

00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:31,300
yes, so what we say in the chemo protocol,

00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,940
you fast the daily for chemo.

00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:34,980
So 24 hours.

00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:37,620
So if your chemo infusion is at 9 o'clock,

00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:41,780
Tuesday morning like in this example,

00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:44,660
then you would start fasting at 9 o'clock,

00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:47,380
Monday morning, and then as soon as you come home

00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,100
from chemo infusion, then you could eat.

